On Nov 28, 2020, Ethereum Classic activated Thanos (ECIP-1099).

It shrank the mining DAG, so 3GB and 4GB GPUs that were being locked out could keep mining ETC.

Hashrate doubled in the following four weeks, and by May 2021 it was up 770%.

More miners securing the chain makes it harder to attack.